FAQ=[('All four services, really from one team?','Yes. Tax & accounting, web and app development, social media management and digital marketing are all handled by Sumair Innovations. One team, one conversation, a complete picture of your business.'),('Can I start with just one service?','Absolutely. Every service is available individually, whether you need a single ITR filing or a new website. You can add other services whenever your business needs them.'),('Do you work outside Kopargaon?','We’re based in Kopargaon taluka and offer local, in-person support. Our technology and digital marketing services can also be delivered remotely, wherever your business is based.'),('How much will it cost?','Pricing depends on your requirements and the scope of work. Tell us what you have in mind and we’ll share a clear quote before starting. Your first consultation is free.'),('How do I get started?','Call us, message us on WhatsApp, or use the inquiry form below. We’ll arrange a free consultation to understand your needs and work out the next step together.')]
